  "id": "BUG-003",
  "title": "Cart is not emptied after checkout when a new item is added",
  "description": "After checking out a cart containing one keyboard, the cart appears empty. Adding a wireless mouse afterwards should leave the cart with only that one new item.",
  "target": {
    "kind": "web",
    "baseUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:60595/"
